{"seq":1,"slug":"why-index","title":"索引为何存在：从全表扫描到定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-indexing/foundations/why-index","wordCount":1506,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"索引为何存在-从全表扫描到定位\">索引为何存在：从全表扫描到定位</h1><p>设想一张存了一亿条订单的表，你要找出订单号为 <code>ORD-88273914</code> 的那一行。没有索引时，数据库别无选择，只能从第一行开始逐行比对，直到撞上目标或读完整张表——这就是全表扫描（full table scan）。一亿行里要找一行，平均要读五千万行，最坏要读完一亿行。问题的核心不在于 CPU 比对的快慢，而在于这一亿行数据躺在磁盘上，把它们一页页搬进内存的 I/O 代价才是真正的瓶颈。索引存在的全部理由，就是把这种「逐行翻找」变成「直接定位」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>索引存在的全部理由，是把「逐行翻找」的全表扫描换成「直接定位」。围绕这笔交易，有三个必须一起理解的量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>全表扫描</th>\n<th>索引查找</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，随数据量线性增长</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_b N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，近似常数级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>瓶颈</td>\n<td>磁盘 I/O：读全部数据页</td>\n<td>少量页读取 + 可能的随机回表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代价</td>\n<td>不占额外空间、写入无负担</td>\n<td>额外存储 + 每次写入都要维护</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>收益端</strong>：预先把被查列组织成有序结构，查找时沿结构「跳着走」，每步排除掉一批行，亿级数据从读百万页降到读个位数页。</li>\n<li><strong>成本端</strong>：多一份索引结构占空间；每次 <code>INSERT</code>/<code>UPDATE</code>/<code>DELETE</code> 都要同步维护它。</li>\n<li><strong>边界</strong>：当查询要返回的行占全表比例过高（约 5%–20% 以上），或列选择性极低时，索引反而不如顺序全表扫描。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"全表扫描的真实代价\">全表扫描的真实代价</h2><p>数据库不是按行读磁盘的，而是按「页」（page，PostgreSQL 默认 8KB，InnoDB 默认 16KB）。一次磁盘 I/O 读一整页。假设每页能装 100 行，那么一亿行就分布在一百万个页里。全表扫描意味着要发起约一百万次顺序页读取。</p>\n<p>代价的关键变量是数据量。设表有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 行、每页 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 行，则扫描需要读取的页数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{scan} = \\lceil N / R \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是一个随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 线性增长的量，时间复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。数据翻十倍，扫描时间也翻十倍。下表用具体数字感受这种增长：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>行数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>页数（每页 100 行）</th>\n<th>全表扫描估算耗时（顺序读 200MB/s）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 万</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100 万</td>\n<td>1 万</td>\n<td>约 80 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 亿</td>\n<td>100 万</td>\n<td>约 8 s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100 亿</td>\n<td>1 亿</td>\n<td>约 800 s（13 分钟）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>8 秒查一行订单，在任何在线业务里都是灾难。而且这还是顺序读的乐观估算——若是机械盘上的随机读，代价还要再放大一两个数量级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"索引把线性查找变成对数定位\">索引把线性查找变成对数定位</h2><p>索引的核心思想是：预先把被查列的值按某种有序结构组织好，查询时不再扫全表，而是沿着这个结构「跳着走」，每一步都排除掉一大批不可能的行。最典型的 B+ 树索引把查找的时间复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_b N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是每个树节点的扇出（fan-out，可达数百）。</p>\n<p>差距有多大？同样一亿行，对数级查找的磁盘访问次数是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>N</mi><mo>≈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>100</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{index} = \\log_b N \\approx \\log_{100}(10^8) = 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">100</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说，从读一百万个页，骤降到只读约 3 到 4 个页就能定位到目标行。这正是索引「以空间换时间」杠杆的全部威力——多存一份有序的索引结构，换来查询代价从线性塌缩到对数。B+ 树为何能做到这一点、它的内部如何组织，是 <a href=\"../structures/btree-indexes\">B 树与 B+ 树索引</a> 的主题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q[&quot;查询: 订单号 = ORD-88273914&quot;] --&gt; D{&quot;有可用索引?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| FS[&quot;全表扫描&lt;br/&gt;逐页读取 O(N)&lt;br/&gt;1 亿行 → 100 万页&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| IS[&quot;索引查找&lt;br/&gt;沿树下降 O(log N)&lt;br/&gt;1 亿行 → 约 4 页&quot;]&#10;    FS --&gt; R[&quot;返回结果&lt;br/&gt;耗时约 8 s&quot;]&#10;    IS --&gt; H{&quot;需要的列&lt;br/&gt;都在索引里?&quot;}&#10;    H --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| R2[&quot;仅索引扫描&lt;br/&gt;耗时约 ms 级&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| BK[&quot;回表取整行&lt;br/&gt;+1 次随机 I/O&quot;]&#10;    BK --&gt; R2\">flowchart TD\n    Q[\"查询: 订单号 = ORD-88273914\"] --&gt; D{\"有可用索引?\"}\n    D --&gt;|\"否\"| FS[\"全表扫描&lt;br/&gt;逐页读取 O(N)&lt;br/&gt;1 亿行 → 100 万页\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"是\"| IS[\"索引查找&lt;br/&gt;沿树下降 O(log N)&lt;br/&gt;1 亿行 → 约 4 页\"]\n    FS --&gt; R[\"返回结果&lt;br/&gt;耗时约 8 s\"]\n    IS --&gt; H{\"需要的列&lt;br/&gt;都在索引里?\"}\n    H --&gt;|\"是\"| R2[\"仅索引扫描&lt;br/&gt;耗时约 ms 级\"]\n    H --&gt;|\"否\"| BK[\"回表取整行&lt;br/&gt;+1 次随机 I/O\"]\n    BK --&gt; R2</pre><h2 id=\"不是所有查询都该走索引\">不是所有查询都该走索引</h2><p>索引并非银弹。当一个查询要返回的行占了全表很大比例时，走索引反而更慢——因为索引扫描每命中一行往往要回表做一次随机 I/O，而全表扫描是高效的顺序 I/O。一个经验法则是：当结果集超过全表约 5% 到 20%（具体阈值由优化器按代价模型计算）时，全表扫描反而胜出。</p>\n<p>举个直观的例子：在一张「性别」列上建索引几乎没有意义，因为它只有两个值，任何查询都会命中接近一半的行，索引带来的随机回表开销远超顺序扫描。这背后的判断标准，正是「选择性」——一个贯穿索引设计的核心概念，将在 <a href=\"index-concepts\">索引核心概念</a> 中详细展开。而优化器具体如何在「走索引」和「全表扫描」之间权衡、又如何被 <code>EXPLAIN</code> 观察到，是 <a href=\"access-paths\">访问路径与索引使用</a> 的内容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"写入的隐藏成本\">写入的隐藏成本</h2><p>读得快从来不是免费的。每建一个索引，就意味着每次 <code>INSERT</code>、<code>UPDATE</code>、<code>DELETE</code> 不仅要改数据本身，还要同步维护这个索引结构——B 树要分裂或合并节点，有序性要被保持。一张表上索引越多，写入越慢、占用空间越大。</p>\n<p>这就是索引的本质交易：用额外的存储空间和更慢的写入，换取快得多的读取。理解这笔交易的两端，才能在第四章里做出明智的<a href=\"../design/index-selection\">索引选型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>全表扫描的代价随数据量线性增长（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），瓶颈在磁盘 I/O 而非 CPU；亿级数据上一次扫描可达秒级甚至分钟级。</li>\n<li>索引通过预先组织有序结构，把查找从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_b N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，亿级数据从读百万页降到读个位数页。</li>\n<li>索引不是万能的：高比例结果集、低选择性列上，全表扫描反而更优。</li>\n<li>索引是「以空间换时间、以写换读」的交易；读取加速的代价是更慢的写入和更多的存储。</li>\n<li>这三点——代价、收益、取舍——构成了后续所有结构选择与设计决策的出发点。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"索引为何存在：从全表扫描到定位","id":"索引为何存在-从全表扫描到定位"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"全表扫描的真实代价","id":"全表扫描的真实代价"},{"level":2,"text":"索引把线性查找变成对数定位","id":"索引把线性查找变成对数定位"},{"level":2,"text":"不是所有查询都该走索引","id":"不是所有查询都该走索引"},{"level":2,"text":"写入的隐藏成本","id":"写入的隐藏成本"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"索引核心概念：聚簇、非聚簇与选择性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-indexing/foundations/index-concepts"}}